{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04748","headline":"端午三殿侍宴应制探得鱼字 · 张说","name":"端午三殿侍宴应制探得鱼字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小暑夏弦应，徽音商管初。\n愿齎长命缕，来续大恩余。\n三殿褰珠箔，羣官上玉除。\n助阳尝麦彘，顺节进龟鱼。\n甘露垂天酒，芝花捧御书。\n合丹同蝘蜓，灰骨共蟾蜍。\n今日伤蛇意，衔珠遂阙如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04748.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04748","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}